(7408740, 1167212, 65234, '<td valign="top">I don''t even know where to start.  It''s ... absurd, in the most fascinating way.   Grunge and Mickey Mouse ears and a defiant child and a woman being attacked by seagulls.  And a completely out-of-context sign.  These things don''t go together. I could look at this all day just puzzling at the scene and trying to make sense of it. Very well done!</td>', 'I don''t even know where to start.  It''s ... absurd, in the most fascinating way.   Grunge and Mickey Mouse ears and a defiant child and a woman being attacked by seagulls.  And a completely out-of-context sign.  These things don''t go together. I could look at this all day just puzzling at the scene and trying to make sense of it. Very well done!', '2015-10-07 19:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408741, 1167314, 65234, '<td valign="top">A National Geographic shot.  So would like to see something like this (with a very long zoom).</td>', 'A National Geographic shot.  So would like to see something like this (with a very long zoom).', '2015-10-07 19:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
