(7409005, 1166316, 50695, '<td valign="top">I have the same feeling as your Surreal photo. If you described this photo to me, I''d say it was cliche, but actually seeing it is a different experience. The way they''re reaching down into their reflections like Narcissi, and that upward angle, it''s just stunning. This would have been at least a gallery had I finished voting.</td>', 'I have the same feeling as your Surreal photo. If you described this photo to me, I''d say it was cliche, but actually seeing it is a different experience. The way they''re reaching down into their reflections like Narcissi, and that upward angle, it''s just stunning. This would have been at least a gallery had I finished voting.', '2015-10-08 14:09:03.000000', NULL, 0),
