(7409031, 1166827, 19959, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your votes and kind comments. I was lucky enough to enjoy a trip to Iceland and took advantage of some dramatic light in the morning. I had driven to a Hotel the day before and in the morning I got up in the dark and turned out onto route 1 along a previously un-explored stretch of road. This scene greeted me after 10 minutes of driving and that sums up Iceland for me... beauty round almost every corner.<br/> <br/>Here are some other shots taken at the time:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1167647" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/19959/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167647.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/19959/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167647.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/19959/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167647.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1167646" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/19959/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167646.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/19959/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167646.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/19959/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167646.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1167648" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/19959/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167648.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/19959/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167648.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/19959/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167648.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-10-08 16:19:23.</i></td>', 'Thank you all for your votes and kind comments. I was lucky enough to enjoy a trip to Iceland and took advantage of some dramatic light in the morning. I had driven to a Hotel the day before and in the morning I got up in the dark and turned out onto route 1 along a previously un-explored stretch of road. This scene greeted me after 10 minutes of driving and that sums up Iceland for me... beauty round almost every corner. Here are some other shots taken at the time:    ', '2015-10-08 17:11:39.000000', '2015-10-08 17:19:23.000000', 0),
